    "media:imagetext": "DISTRIBUTED\nBY KOCH NEWS CO., 2120 S. MERIDIAN ST., INDIANAPOLIS, IND.\nWEIR COOK MUNICIPAL AIRPORT\nINDIANAPOLIS, INDIANA\nOwned by the City and operated by a Bi-\nPartisan Board of Aviation Commissioners, the\nAirport covers an area of 1,350 Acres, located\n6½ miles Southwest from downtown business\ndistrict. The Beautiful new Administration\nBuilding was dedicated Oct. 19, 1956. Weir\nCook Airport is served by American, Eastern,\nTrans World, Delta, Lake Central, Ozark Air\nLines and the new 7,300-foot runway will\ntake care of all Jet Planes.\nX\n- 3°\nGENUINE CURTEICH-CHICAGO \"c.T. ART-COLORTONE\" POST CARD (REG. U.S. PAT. OFF.)\nPOST CARD\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\n7C-H58\n2015.166.1993",
